<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://www.loveinartsz.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/damienhirstleadimage-1.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-9980"/><figcaption>Damien Hirst, In Love and Out of Love, 2012</figcaption></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://www.loveinartsz.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/image-5.png" alt="" class="wp-image-9981"/><figcaption>Damien Hirst, In Love and Out of Love, 2012</figcaption></figure>
